  "<strong>Perception</strong> gathers what the agent can know, <strong>reasoning</strong> chooses what to do, and <strong>action</strong> changes the environment. Perception and action often come from an existing interaction model, whether it controls a vacuum, web automation, a game entity, or a humanoid. The reasoning step can change without changing that boundary, which separates capability from reach.": "<strong>感知</strong>负责收集智能体能够获知的信息，<strong>推理</strong>决定要做什么，<strong>行动</strong>则改变环境。感知和行动通常源自现有的交互模型，无论它控制的是吸尘器、Web 自动化程序、游戏实体还是人形机器人。推理步骤可以在不改变这一边界的情况下发生变化，从而将能力与触达范围区分开来。",
  "<span class=\"learning-scope\">Deep · Concepts</span><span class=\"learning-question\">Explore the loop and classic architectures?</span>": "<span class=\"learning-scope\">深入 · 概念</span><span class=\"learning-question\">探索智能体循环和经典架构？</span>",
